From: Logos Maps <maps@logos.co>
Subject: [PATCH] Map/Settings: on-disk cache default, prefetch delta, debug options

Settings::setCacheDatabasePath(QString()) now selects an on-disk cache in
QStandardPaths::CacheLocation/QMapLibre/cache.db (directory created on
demand; falls back to :memory: when unavailable). The default stays
:memory:. Adds Map::setPrefetchZoomDelta/prefetchZoomDelta and
Map::setDebugOptions/debugOptions (QFlags over mbgl::MapDebugOptions).

Optional (capability-gated): cache §15.3, debug overlays.

Upstream base: maplibre/maplibre-native-qt c3485f3 (docs/architecture.md section 14.1).
---
 src/core/map.cpp      | 62 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/core/map.hpp      | 20 +++++++++++++++++
 src/core/settings.cpp | 28 +++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

